Hi=C2=A0Shubham,

=C2=A0

Just a few hours ago, we released [a nice recap video](https://4ntll.r.sp1-=
brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfsTSz57aqxQDwjt4eorw9a/Ol_9SslvSvxM) from thi=
s year's EU-Startups Summit, and I thought I'd share it with you. :)

=C2=A0

By the way: Have you already marked your calendar for next year's edition?=
=C2=A0In case you missed it, next year's [EU-Startups Summit](https://4ntll=
.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfuMSVaQZQBsGJ3hF1Jeg66/KGmAMJj7V6Lh) w=
ill be held on May 7-8, again in beautiful Malta!

=C2=A0

In the meantime, we're currently brainstorming about how to further optimis=
e our editorial output, so we're curious to learn what your preferred chann=
els are for consuming startup-related content? You can let us know [here](h=
ttps://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfwFS25jXzQKIfNVPNoRQ2c/5tI=
ASVgbXiez).=C2=A0

=C2=A0

And we're also curious which areas of tech innovation you are mainly intere=
sted in. Unfortunately LinkedIn polls only allow for 4 options, but please =
feel free to state your other areas of interest in the comments [here](http=
s://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfy8RYb2WYemL1hJZkJE9z8/MD1-R-=
Sj93nX).

=C2=A0

Last but not least: In case you or someone you know is working on ClimateTe=
ch, I wanted to share that tomorrow is the deadline for the [Amazon Sustain=
ability Accelerator](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng01R=
56LV7tENO17k6o0tve/JbOJooNaYw_w), which is supporting startups in energy, w=
aste, and water innovation. Selected teams will get expert support, $10K in=
 AWS credits, and the chance to pilot their tech with Amazon. The hybrid pr=
ogramme runs from 8 Sept. to 3 October.

=C2=A0

Have a great week!

=C2=A0

Sunny greetings,

Thomas
=C2=A0
